  "readmeFile": "EXCEL-README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First public alpha. Reads, edits and writes a documented subset of ordinary XLSX workbooks: values, shared or inline strings, dates, explicit formulas with caller-supplied caches, basic styles, column widths and row heights, frozen panes, autofilter, merged cells and validated external/internal hyperlinks. WorkbookReader streams row values forward-only for large imports without building a workbook, and unsupported sheet features never block it. Unsupported content is diagnosed rather than silently dropped. No calculation engine and no arbitrary lossless round-trip; see the package README for the exact subset.",
